  "system": {
    "featureForm": "action",
    "description": "<p><strong>Mark a Stress</strong> to have the @Lookup[@name] squirt ink. On land, the ink covers the ground within Very Close range. Each creature who moves through that area must succeed on an Agility Reaction Roll or slip and fall, becoming <em>Vulnerable</em> until they exit the area. If this feature is used while the @Lookup[@name] is underwater, it instead creates a cloud of darkness that fills an area within Very Close range and blocks line of sight.</p>",
